WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:22.925
Jeb drove between the cones.

2
00:00:22.926 --> 00:00:33.386
"Very safe driving!" said Ms. Fender.

3
00:00:33.387 --> 00:00:37.922
Jeb drove toward a stop sign.

4
00:00:37.923 --> 00:00:41.935
"Obey the sign," said Ms. Fender.

5
00:00:41.936 --> 00:00:44.627
Jeb stopped at the sign.

6
00:00:44.628 --> 00:00:46.967
He looked both ways.

7
00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:53.751
Then he drove some more.

8
00:00:53.752 --> 00:00:56.500
A green light turned yellow.

9
00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:58.835
Jeb slowed down.

10
00:00:58.836 --> 00:01:01.555
The light turned red.

11
00:01:01.556 --> 00:01:04.212
Jeb stopped.

12
00:01:04.213 --> 00:01:06.751
Zippy whispered to Eddy.

13
00:01:06.752 --> 00:01:10.142
"You're good at slowing down.

14
00:01:10.143 --> 00:01:12.831
Because you're slow!"

15
00:01:12.832 --> 00:01:16.298
"I'm not slow," said Eddy.

16
00:01:16.299 --> 00:01:20.753
The light turned green.

17
00:01:20.754 --> 00:01:26.590
Jeb drove some more.

18
00:01:26.591 --> 00:01:32.963
Soon he was done.

19
00:01:32.964 --> 00:01:36.507
"Good job," said Ms. Fender.

20
00:01:36.508 --> 00:01:43.254
"It's Zippy's turn now."

21
00:01:43.255 --> 00:01:46.752
Zippy drove to the track.

22
00:01:46.753 --> 00:01:49.145
Zippy smiled.

23
00:01:49.146 --> 00:01:54.796
"This will be easy!

24
00:01:54.797 --> 00:02:00.491
I'm the best at everything!"
